; Diane Fort — Cup Outline G-code
; Food Printing assignment
;
; CUP STRUCTURE:
;   Outline: solid base (layer 1) + circular wall (layers 2+)
;   Fill   : concentric rings inside cup (second material)
;
; Wall layers: 6
; Layer height: 2.0 mm
; Base Z: 2.50 mm
; Wall top Z: 14.50 mm
; Radius: 26.0 mm  (diameter 52.0 mm)
; Center: (100, 100)
; Print speed: 500 mm/min
; Extrusion mult: 0.035
; Layer 1=base fill  |  Layers 2+= wall circle

; === INITIALIZATION ===
G21              ; Set units to millimeters
G90              ; Absolute positioning
M82              ; Absolute extrusion mode
G28              ; Home all axes

